msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/standpointClaimFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:standpointClaim, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "À lire avec logic:characteristicSort : le couple (logic:characterizes gmeow:standpointClaim, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) constitue l'obligation entière, et la vue de fondement OWL en projette la caractéristique correspondante."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/standpointClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:standpointClaimFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:standpointClaim ."
msgstr "gmeow:standpointClaimFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:standpointClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureStandpointFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:tenureStandpoint names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "À utiliser lorsque le portail de cohérence natif doit garantir que gmeow:tenureStandpoint nomme exactement une valeur ; cet enregistrement est le porteur canonique que le portail joint, de sorte que l'obligation est raisonnée plutôt que redite sur une surface de formes."

